{"duration_api_ms":8490,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"9f264e93-2256-4e53-a03e-b11cd46317d5","total_cost_usd":0.0011139,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":757,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1372,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":961},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":757,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1372,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":757,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":757},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1300,"outputTokens":1665,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":757,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0011139,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1233,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":757,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Investigate before concluding arbitrage has failed:**\n\n1. **Timing and valuation:** Confirm premiums and discounts are measured against contemporaneous NAV or iNAV, not stale or end-of-day figures. Check whether foreign or thinly traded holdings were fair-valued, and whether the gap coincides with closed-market hours.\n2. **Peers:** Compare with ETFs holding similar assets or tracking the same index. Is the pattern fund-specific or sector-wide?\n3. **Underlying frictions:** Assess holdings' liquidity, bid-ask spreads, halts, settlement timing, and time-zone effects.\n4. **AP and market-maker participation:** Review creation and redemption activity, the number of active APs, basket composition, and any capacity or balance-sheet constraints.\n5. **Data integrity:** Verify iNAV calculations, pricing feeds, and trade reporting.\n\n**Corrective options, chosen to fit the findings:** improve disclosure or fair-value methodology, recruit additional APs or market makers, adjust basket or in-kind processes, add liquidity commitments, revisit portfolio or index construction, or pursue adviser remediation. Document conclusions and reassess periodically.","ttft_ms":5507,"type":"result","duration_ms":6923,"uuid":"f6397e66-550b-4116-b915-e5b5e3202636","ttft_stream_ms":497,"time_to_request_ms":59,"first_content_frame_ms":497,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
